    "$t": "Lán來講看māi - 重溪kap雙溪"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">重溪kap雙溪</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span>Bí-hûn</h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwpJboruS3uoz6Y0gJL99qnlwldquIxRY5bUzJROWzHz3aZsrz3iDcIYgWQGkEoooS3VXu03rP9y03Y6CAwYQMv3Npwy7z35EqBpj87H_Ld9vsXisBS527k1H1T1NxVOjYerGB2c9V5tY23jvsBJLFFqkFvYdEOlOjGUpm9AeVi3rUXbjeXJ9m120BqvgU\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwpJboruS3uoz6Y0gJL99qnlwldquIxRY5bUzJROWzHz3aZsrz3iDcIYgWQGkEoooS3VXu03rP9y03Y6CAwYQMv3Npwy7z35EqBpj87H_Ld9vsXisBS527k1H1T1NxVOjYerGB2c9V5tY23jvsBJLFFqkFvYdEOlOjGUpm9AeVi3rUXbjeXJ9m120BqvgU=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgiE-i1RH2X9EtLNl-86AlUSXX7K_XNwvsNZQm45dvi8o5V-z3J5MEClM1XX_bbAU3vkuKhuGM8bfTrx9bEn-dPpztHCXnPPzFUBeZCPVPMUt5Px3Lpivf4JXoYqH_3muUvhFTU8_r-Ebi1jK57yyuKj1NVkKuFAaLUrxC5gtv0ub6BCAijOYySUhSjJIft=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEioFtp5LObjSloinSFd6ymiBPRzgPu2NcAG1XrhGXP_-vvAXE7rYka_5SYnu4YJMeXBQ4uT3UBpgoP49zshEn4iXg_BNdtuJt52MEjqo84ZT42xFlTtc-p5jlQJBD6RslUPSTIr7s4vLO3cVdn-PZ3rBhcD3sXh64SIHCSN-YIyqjOPUa-lwoaPnF9Plm5K=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></span></div></div></span></div></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Tī屏東車城鄉（Chhâ-siâⁿ-hiong）有庄頭kap溪水本底lóng號做「四重溪」（Sì-têng-khe），後--來chit搭溫泉siuⁿ有名，庄頭改號做「溫泉村」，m̄-koh chit條溪猶原號做「四重溪」。車城鄉公所網站有記--著，éng過按平地beh入來到chia，lóng tio̍h liâu溪，又koh tio̍h se̍h過四改彎溪，m̄-chiah號做「四重溪」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Éng過bat駛車tùi車城ê 26號公路oat入去199號縣路，駛ǹg四重溪庄頭。看著四重溪ê溪水一重koh一重流--落-來，有tang時仔koh彎出去到遠遠無看--見，án-ne看溪水彎來彎去，khah-ke古早ê台語人kā號做chiah-nī有台語味ê「四重溪」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Bat看過四重溪社區網站，社區阿公、阿媽lóng ē-hiáu講弓蕉白仔話。一改去四重溪ê潘--氏農場買鹹鴨卵，正經聽著潘阿媽leh làu弓蕉白仔話。又koh chia-ê弓蕉白仔話kap高雄甲仙ê大武壠族人仝款。弓蕉白仔話是平埔族人chiah有--ê，m̄-koh平埔族ê語言lóng無--去--ah，m̄-chiah講是「台語ê弓蕉白仔話」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>弓蕉白仔話是kā一句話ê逐字koh加一字，加chit字是「s ê音+韻母」。像講一對tng-leh熱戀ê 查埔kā查某講：「Lán sān暗sām頓sn̄g食siah飽sā來sāi去sī溪sē墘sīⁿ公sōng園sn̄g散sān步sō͘」。Án-ne m̄-niā in ê話ē-tàng「加密」，in ê感情mā ē-tàng「加蜜」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Koh有訪談蹛花蓮富里鄉明里村90歲ê潘期田先生講起，祖先是平埔族人按車城四重溪搬--來--ê，伊是第四代。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Iáu有tī Google地圖有記著beh去四重溪庄頭ê半路，mā有號做「二重溪」（Jī-têng-khe）ê地名，káⁿ是仝款都合ài se̍h過兩改彎溪。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Koh來，tī台南大內區mā有號做「二重溪」ê所在。Tī在地二溪國小ê網站記錄，éng過按西爿ê善化beh行路到chia，沿路曾文溪有tńg兩个大彎溪，án-ne決定ē拄著曾文溪兩遍，tio̍h起起落落liâu兩擺過溪，m̄-chiah號做「二重溪」。Tī戰後改號做「二溪」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>維基百科記錄台灣有幾若个「二重溪」ê地名，像：tī台南東山區有一个「二重溪」，he是ài se̍h過龜重溪，chiah ē án-ne號名。Tī南投中寮鄉mā有「二重溪」ê地名，he是ài se̍h過平林溪。Tī桃園楊梅區有地名kap溪水lóng號做「二重溪」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Koh有，台南白河區beh倚關仔嶺有庄頭kap溪水lóng號做「六重溪」。Hia有一个「六重溪平埔文化園區」，hia-ê平埔族古早號做「Tevorang」，尾手叫做大武壠（Tāi-bú-long）ê Kuva（台語號做「公廨」），便若到農曆9月14暗暝，就是族人夜祭ê日子。文史學者講chia-ê族人kap高雄甲仙ê平埔仝款是大武壠族，m̄-koh六重溪ê大武壠族人是ùi台南玉井區遷徙來--ê。Lán若是去到玉井ê舊街，ē-sái斟酌揣看有一間漢藥店ê匾仔寫「大武壠濟生堂」，邊--a koh有一間「大武壠北極殿」，廟內有兩塊清國年代ê石碑mā有記著「大武壠祖廟」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Sòa--來，講一个地圖揣無ê「十八重溪」。台南東山區（Tong-san-khu）有一項「國家指定重要民俗文化」，tī農曆2月初2到2月初9，東山碧軒寺佛祖媽出巡十八重溪內。Che十八重溪內是leh講，tī東山東爿淺山ê白水溪、六重溪kap龜重溪ê範圍合做伙號做「十八重溪內」。佛祖媽出巡就是tī che十八重溪內ê庄頭。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Koh kā徙到東山khah南爿ê柳營，有庄頭號做「小腳腿」（Sió-kha-thúi）。Hia有一間「重溪國小」，tī日本時代號做「查畝營公學校小腳腿分校」，本底地名就是「小腳腿」。Tī國立台南藝術大學大崎通訊有記錄三个小腳腿ê由來，我khah信講he是按Siraya平埔族語「Nounog」來--ê。意思是講ùi東爿淺山流--來ê龜重溪tī chia流入去急水溪，彎溪像人ê跤腿án-ne開--開，m̄-niā有小腳腿，隔壁庄頭koh號做「大腳腿」。戰後kā小腳腿分校改名做重溪國小。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>看--起-來溪水彎入去別个溪水mā號做「重溪」，khah-ke屏東里港鄉有隘寮溪tī chia流入去荖濃溪ê hit段溪水ē號做「二重溪」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「彎溪」kap「雙溪」是真súi ê地名，tī當地定著有兩條彎溪會齊。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Tī台灣東北角新北市ê山區有雙溪區，éng過叫「頂雙溪」，chia有平林溪kap牡丹溪會齊做伙chiâⁿ做「雙溪」，雙溪ǹg東爿流去貢仔寮（Khōng-á-liâu）、福隆入去太平洋。Chia lóng是山區，生活步步tio̍h借水路，m̄-chiah有舊街ia̍h有清國時代ê渡船頭遺跡，又koh古早北部淡水廳beh到宜蘭頭城鎮ê「淡蘭古道彎潭段」tio̍h-ài經過chia。Che頂雙溪定著有chhiaⁿ-iāⁿ--一-站-仔。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>台北市士林ê草山（陽明山），有一條內雙溪kap菁礐溪（Chhiⁿ-ha̍k-khe）會齊做伙，chiâⁿ做外雙溪，尾手流入去基隆河。新竹縣寶山鄉上大ê庄頭號做「雙溪村」，káⁿ是有客雅溪kap雙溪會齊chiah ē號做「雙溪」。嘉義縣梅山鄉mā有「雙溪村」，he是九芎坑溪kap南靖溪會齊。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Tī嘉義縣朴子市有「雙溪口社區」，he是按嘉義縣竹崎鄉來ê牛稠溪（Gû-tiâu-khe）流到嘉義縣民雄鄉分做大細兩條溪，來到chia大細兩條溪koh會齊做伙chiâⁿ做朴子溪，án-ne m̄-chiah號做 「雙溪口」。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>溪水有彎溪chiah ē-tàng養飼萬物mā chiah ē súi，人tī chia生活，就有故事、就有文化。</div><div>像一條台語老歌〈母子鳥〉許森淵作曲、陳達儒大師作詞，「楊柳溪邊夜半月娘súi……」唱出未婚少女生一个囝兒，無疑誤ài來到溪邊kā囝兒抱hō͘無緣ê翁婿in兜養飼，ǹg望長大成人chiah來揣阿娘。M̄-niā歌詞寫出感動人ê母愛，曲調真有台語味mā chiâⁿ做有名歌仔戲ê〈母子鳥〉調。</div><div><br /></div><div><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Koh有新北市三峽區ê畫家李梅樹，有幾若幅畫tī溪邊洗衫ê婦jîn人。Chit-má ê溪水m̄是做koân-koân ê駁岸thang防大水，就是做水庫thang農業用、民生用iah是工業用，人真oh得親近溪水。Lán若有行過阿母、阿姊、阿嬸tī溪邊洗衫ê年代，看著hia-ê圖正經ē感動，che就是藝術。</div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 377期，2025年8月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, s